    <string name="about_help">Instructions</string>
    <string name="help_text">Direction buttons: tap to move a small step (for small buttons), or hold to move continuously\nOK: click the element marked by the highlight; nearby buttons are targeted automatically\nHold OK: switch between cursor and scroll modes\nHold BACK: pause/resume Remouse Multilingual\nKeep pushing the cursor against a screen edge: automatically page through content\nVolume +/−: adjust speed\n\nIf a screen does not respond to cursor clicks, hold BACK to pause. The remote immediately returns to its normal direction-button navigation. Hold BACK again to resume the cursor.</string>
